OL,4,BFormer delivery driver Dean earns PGA  
OL,5,BTour card                              
OL,6,GFormer supermarket delivery driver Joe 
OL,7,GDean has continued a whirlwind year by 
OL,8,Gearning a place on the PGA Tour.       
OL,10,FEnglishman Dean, 32, was ranked        
OL,11,F2,930th in the world rankings two      
OL,12,Fyears ago as he worked part time to    
OL,13,Fhelp fund his golf career.             
OL,15,FIn July he earned a place at The Open  
OL,16,Fafter winning the inaugural Last-      
OL,17,FChance Qualifier, but things really    
OL,18,Ftook off for him in August when he     
OL,19,Fclaimed the British Masters title -    
OL,20,Fhis first DP World Tour win in his     
OL,21,F70th event.                            
